{"parse": {"title": "种瓜得瓜-05", "pageid": 93758, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A7%8D%E7%93%9C%E5%BE%97%E7%93%9C-04\" title=\"种瓜得瓜-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">种瓜得瓜-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A7%8D%E7%93%9C%E5%BE%97%E7%93%9C-06\" title=\"种瓜得瓜-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">种瓜得瓜</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.A4.A7.E5.AF.92\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"大寒\">大寒</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 大寒</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Severe Cold</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-632001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-632001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-632001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"127\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">神秘学警察Ⅰ：</div><div>A小队已就位，已通过检测暂时排除余震可能性，可派人进一步支援。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632002.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-632002.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632002.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-632002.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-632002.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">神秘学警察Ⅱ：</div><div>案件编号2085C39570，目标现已被控制。将由机动运输队送往生物化验科做进一步研究。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjian\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/600px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/900px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/1200px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-311010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-311010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-311010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>所以……我把它救下来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>老天爷，你别再让我回忆起来了，我人都要吓晕了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>你知道当时大家有多紧张吗？你非要赶在一齐发射的档口冲出去，我们当时都以为你疯了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>结果就是，你中弹了。那玩意儿也中弹了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-311010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-311010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-311010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>什么？它也中弹了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>是的，但最新一批专门针对地下目魔精的诱捕弹用处微乎其微，所有打在它身上的子弹都被吸收和溶解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>非常怪异的异变。恐怕只有像你这样不要命的近距离接触，才能够通过将强力催眠安抚弹灌入它鼻腔的方式控制住它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>在那之后，你中弹了，它也很快熟睡，被你紧紧抱着不撒手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-311013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-311013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-311013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>所以现在它怎么样？还活着吗？它在哪里？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-630411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-630411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-630411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"130\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>噢噢——嘿，嘿，别急……别急……<br />该死，我记得他们给你注射过镇定剂了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>波蒂埃的神情看上去有些紧张。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>是这样的，你得耐心听我说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>波蒂埃拍了拍梁月的肩膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>它没死。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-311013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-311013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-311013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>……谢天谢地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-311013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-311013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-311013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>我能去看它吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>波蒂埃摁住梁月。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>……等一下，安静，静下来。你再着急也没有用，你现在下不了床。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311016.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-311016.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311016.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311016.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-311016.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311016.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-311016.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311016.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眉尾带痣的少女用难缠的眼神紧盯着她身旁的教官。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311017.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311017.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311017.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311017.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311017.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311017.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311017.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311017.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>……波蒂埃教官？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>事实是——它并不是强梁，梁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>它只是一种名为虻呷虻呷的魔精，地下目沙米尔蠕虫属。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>我们第一时间将这种魔精的资料发送给基金会，这是那边传真过来的记录。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>它是一种记录在册的魔精，是北美的第一例，但在亚洲及非洲，已经见到过好几例与之相同的例子了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>针对这种魔精的研究还在继续进行，暂未收到有关其导电的相关原理报告。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>但肉眼可见的是，排除在此之前的所有调查，它和强梁从头到尾都不一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>从外观、性状、繁殖特征到根据“克鲁山德命名法”所进行的分类，它与强梁都不一样，它是已知、可查、可捕捉、可实验的生物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>而强梁，不属于任何。无法归类，无法研究。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无可懂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>似有风从门缝吹入。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>摆在床头的鲜花垂着脑袋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311016.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-311016.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311016.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311016.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-311016.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311016.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-311016.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311016.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630406.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-630406.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630406.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630406.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-630406.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630406.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-630406.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630406.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-630411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-630411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-630411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"130\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>……很抱歉……但是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>波蒂埃看着梁月。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-311001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-311001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-311001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>它不是强梁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-630411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-630411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-630411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"130\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>波蒂埃停顿了一下，而后深吸一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-630411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-630411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-630411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"130\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>或许我们不得不承认一个事实，那就是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-630411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-630411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-630411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"130\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>强梁是确凿无疑地——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-630411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-630411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-630411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"130\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>消失在这个世界上了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>                                                                                                          第五節 大寒</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个月后。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_5_bg_fanzuike1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_5_bg_fanzuike1\"><img alt=\"2_5_bg_fanzuike1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/Cg-2_5_bg_fanzuike1.png/600px-Cg-2_5_bg_fanzuike1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/Cg-2_5_bg_fanzuike1.png/900px-Cg-2_5_bg_fanzuike1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/Cg-2_5_bg_fanzuike1.png/1200px-Cg-2_5_bg_fanzuike1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630405.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-630405.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630405.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630405.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-630405.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630405.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-630405.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630405.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>恭喜梁警员顺利出院——！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>……什？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>迎面飘落的彩带被梁月吃到嘴里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-311012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-311012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-311012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>咳咳、咳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>怎么回事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>梁月环视了一下四周，在波蒂埃背后还站着几个抱着捧花的同僚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>我以为经过这次事件，局里应该没人再待见我了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>呃……对，你确实违反了一点点相关行动准则条例——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>但事实是，多亏了你冲过去往那大块头嘴里塞了最大剂量的安抚弹，我们才能成功捕获它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>而那些之前怀疑过你的人，在发现作案魔精与强梁并无关系之后，出于歉意，托我给你带些热狗券。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>不过，埃尔登警长刚才发了好大一通火，处罚看来是不可避免的了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>你最好小心点，这次我可没有理由陪你去档案库值班了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>哈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>梁月低下头笑了笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>……谢谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-630911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-630911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-630911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃尔登警长：</div><div>把这些礼花收起来，这里是警局，不是花里胡哨的高中毕业舞会现场！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在埃尔登警长恐怖的环视下，众人默默散去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>埃尔登警长走到梁月身边，他手上拿着牛皮纸袋装着的一打模造纸文件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>梁月看到波蒂埃给自己使了个“赶紧投降”的眼神后就逃之夭夭了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回过头后，埃尔登警长已经站在自己面前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃尔登警长：</div><div>警察法学A+，犯罪心理学A，警务战术A，综合格斗A-，神秘学百科知识A+。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃尔登警长：</div><div>看上去你的考核成绩表上就缺我的这一项分数了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>埃尔登警长摇了摇手中的考核表。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>确认了梁月的目光始终盯着那张薄薄的、散发着油墨的模造纸。埃尔登警长有条不紊地把手背到身后，将纸藏了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃尔登警长：</div><div>我不能保证我能给你多高的分数，毕竟你缺席了我的考试还罔顾我的指挥。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>警长凌厉的目光刺向下属的自尊，却如碎石落入沉潭中，没有一丝声响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>我知道。任何分数我都能接受。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>梁月目视前方，眼中没有波澜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>埃尔登警长凝视着面前的下属，冷笑了一声，凑近。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃尔登警长：</div><div>听着。这只是一张纸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃尔登警长：</div><div>而一旦这张纸，落入之后的重重流程里，它就不再是一张纸了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>风扇叶在头顶吱呀而转，翡翠绿的金龟子在落灰的窗外停留。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃尔登警长：</div><div>这个世界上有许多种警察，有沽名钓誉者，通过与媒体勾结官路亨达；有中饱私囊者，在贪得无厌中走向铁牢的另一面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃尔登警长：</div><div>也有忠肝义胆者，被利用排挤，成为无情的打手和工具；有铁面无私者，亲手将自己曾同甘共苦的手足送上法庭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃尔登警长：</div><div>这个位置不是什么好位置，我见过太多新人警察步入不法后尘。<br />不管做出什么样的选择，他们所要付出的代价，比常人要多得多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃尔登警长：</div><div>“想要成为什么样的警察”？它已经不再是我想要追问的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃尔登警长：</div><div>我想要问的是，为了成为你心中的警察，你能够付出多少代价。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>停顿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>悬置于此的问话，不比审讯室内的言辞逼供要来得轻松。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>我——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她几欲踏前，毋庸置疑的答案在她胸膛中呼之欲出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃尔登警长：</div><div>我不需要你现在回答我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他从口袋里掏出一支黑色水性笔，用另一只手掌托着成绩表。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>结果已定，白纸黑字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>草草挥笔一番后，埃尔登警长将成绩表叠好，收回。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃尔登警长：</div><div>具体的结果，等你回去之后，会有夜巡特遣的人来通知你的。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-tiantai.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"tiantai\"><img alt=\"tiantai\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/Cg-tiantai.png/600px-Cg-tiantai.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/Cg-tiantai.png/900px-Cg-tiantai.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/Cg-tiantai.png/1200px-Cg-tiantai.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>凉风阵阵，散发着暖光的室内传来说笑声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-311013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-311013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-311013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>梁月站在微凉的夜色下许久，望向远方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>熟食店里的热狗香气幽幽传来，她的目光跨越大洋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她慢慢掏出电话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-311001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-311001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-311001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div><i>喂，喂？听得到吗？</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">电话：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁母：</div><div><i>喂？喂！今天怎么知道打个电话回家了？</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>熟悉的声音，跨大洋通过电流传输过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁母：</div><div><i>老梁，老梁别看了，过来，小月来电话了。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁母：</div><div><i>我给座机开个免提，让你爸也听到。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁母：</div><div><i>他昨天还念叨你，说你一过去就没信儿了。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-311013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-311013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-311013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她深吸了一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-311001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-311001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-311001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div><i>实习期快结束了，成绩刚刚已经出来了。但我还不知道最终的结果。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-311001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-311001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-311001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div><i>我在这里过得挺好的，这儿有中餐，我也遇到了好多好人，交了好多朋友。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-311001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-311001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-311001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div><i>每天都很充实，这边的神秘学案件与国内的不太一样。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>听筒那边传来积极的应答声，女儿的一点点信息对于母亲来说都弥足珍贵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-311013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-311013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-311013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-wuyunmibu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"wuyunmibu\"><img alt=\"wuyunmibu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Cg-wuyunmibu.png/600px-Cg-wuyunmibu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Cg-wuyunmibu.png/900px-Cg-wuyunmibu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Cg-wuyunmibu.png/1200px-Cg-wuyunmibu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div><i>……妈。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁母：</div><div><i>嗯？怎么了？</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div><i>强梁丢了。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>儿时她同母亲去抓药，满铺子苦药腥味。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁母：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>芡实、茯苓、当归、柴胡，一克克称开，一颗颗融于水。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div><i>强梁被我弄丢了。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>喉咙的痛感将过去与现在相连。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鼻腔腥苦。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "种瓜得瓜-05"}}